  m_Name: PatApp_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: "You\u2019ve just finished your last study visit and your family has
    planned a small dinner with you to celebrate completing the trial. At the dinner
    table, your brother asks, \u201CSo, now that the trial is over, the treatment
    you received is approved and available to all patients?\u201D\r\n\r\nIs this
    true or false?\r"
  explanation: "Even though the trial has ended, the treatment isn\u2019t automatically
    available to everyone. Researchers still review the results and submit them for
    approval to make sure it\u2019s safe and effective for a wider group of patients.
    By completing the trial, patient participants play a key role in helping others
    access promising new treatments, contributing to the future of care for people
    with the same condition."
  correctAnswer: False
  incorrectAnswer1: True
  incorrectAnswer2: 
  incorrectAnswer3: 
  questionRole: Patient
  questionType: TrueFalse
  questionStage: Approval
